      "en": "**Keep Matches** (only those with a match), **Keep Non-Matches** (those without), **Keep Everything**, and **Enrich Input 1/2** (all of one input + data from the other when found — like a LEFT JOIN). Choose by the question: «who bought?» or «who did not buy?»."
